ar at amazing prices for your studio, event, or personal practice.</p>\\n    <a class=\\\"btn\\\" href=\\\"/yoga-mats\\\">Shop Mats</a>\\n    <a class=\\\"btn secondary\\\" href=\\\"/studio-packs\\\">Shop Studio Packs</a>\\n  </div>\\n</section>\\n\\n<div class=\\\"trust wrap\\\">\\n  <span>&#10003; Manufacturer-direct pricing</span>\\n  <span>&#10003; Trusted by studios since 1999</span>\\n  <span>&#10003; Free shipping over $99</span>\\n  <span>&#10003; Easy returns</span>\\n</div>\\n\\n<div class=\\\"wrap\\\">\\n  <h2 class=\\\"section\\\">Shop by Category</h2>\\n  <p class=\\\"section-sub\\\">Find exactly what your practice needs in one click.</p>\\n  <div class=\\\"cat-tiles\\\">\\n    <a class=\\\"tile\\\" href=\\\"/yoga-mats\\\">Mats</a>\\n    <a class=\\\"tile\\\" href=\\\"/yoga-blocks\\\">Blocks</a>\\n    <a class=\\\"tile\\\" href=\\\"/yoga-straps\\\">Straps</a>\\n    <a class=\\\"tile\\\" href=\\\"/yoga-bolsters\\\">Bolsters</a>\\n    <a class=\\\"tile\\\" href=\\\"/yoga-blankets\\\">Blankets</a>\\n    <a class=\\\"tile\\\" href=\\\"/yoga-kits\\\">Kits</a>\\n    <a class=\\\"tile\\\" href=\\\"/studio-packs\\\">Studio Packs</a>\\n    <a class=\\\"tile\\\" href=\\\"/sale\\\">Sale</a>\\n  </div>\\n\\n  <h2 class=\\\"section\\\">Featured Products</h2>\\n  <p class=\\\"section-sub\\\">Best sellers loved by teachers, studios, and home practitioners.</p>\\n  <div class=\\\"grid\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"ph\\\"></div>\\n      <h3>Classic Yoga Mat</h3>\\n      <div class=\\\"price\\\">From $19.95</div>\\n      <a class=\\\"btn\\\" href=\\\"/yoga-mats\\\">Shop Now</a>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"ph\\\"></div>\\n      <h3>Foam Yoga Block</h3>\\n      <div class=\\\"price\\\">From $6.95</div>\\n      <a class=\\\"btn\\\" href=\\\"/yoga-blocks\\\">Shop Now</a>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"ph\\\"></div>\\n      <h3>Cotton Yoga Strap</h3>\\n      <div class=\\\"price\\\">From $5.95</div>\\n      <a class=\\\"btn\\\" href=\\\"/yoga-straps\\\">Shop Now</a>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"ph\\\"></div>\\n      <h3>Rectangular Bolster</h3>\\n      <div class=\\\"price\\\">From $34.95</div>\\n      <a class=\\\"btn\\\" href=\\\"/yoga-bolsters\\\">Shop Now</a>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"ph\\\"></div>\\n      <h3>Mexican-Style Blanket</h3>\\n      <div class=\\\"price\\\">From $17.95</div>\\n      <a class=\\\"btn\\\" href=\\\"/yoga-blankets\\\">Shop Now</a>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"ph\\\"></div>\\n      <h3>Complete Yoga Kit</h3>\\n      <div class=\\\"price\\\">From $39.95</div>\\n      <a class=\\\"btn\\\" href=\\\"/yoga-kits\\\">Shop Now</a>\\n    </div>\\n  </div>\\n</div>\\n\\n<section class=\\\"about\\\">\\n  <div class=\\\"wrap\\\">\\n    <p>Thanks to our loyal customers, YogaDirect has become one of the largest suppliers of yoga mats and props in the country. We have been faithfully supplying the Yoga community since 1999 and are confident that we can help you grow your studio, event, or personal practice with everything you need and more. We manufacture and source our own goods which is how we can consistently offer high-quality yoga gear at amazing prices. When you shop at YogaDirect, feel proud in knowing that you are helping to grow not only your business or personal practice but the Yoga community as a whole. From our team of Yoga lovers to you, thank you.</p>\\n  </div>\\n</section>\\n\\n<footer>\\n  <div class=\\\"wrap foot-cols\\\">\\n    <div>\\n      <h4>Shop</h4>\\n      <ul>\\n        <li><a href=\\\"/yoga-mats\\\">Mats</a></li>\\n        <li><a href=\\\"/yoga-blocks\\\">Blocks</a></li>\\n        <li><a href=\\\"/yoga-straps\\\">Straps</a></li>\\n        <li><a href=\\\"/yoga-bolsters\\\">Bolsters</a></li>\\n        <li><a href=\\\"/yoga-blankets\\\">Blankets</a></li>\\n        <li><a href=\\\"