ga-mats.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"Rolled yoga mats, blocks and bolsters in a bright studio\\\" loading=\\\"eager\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"hero-badge\\\">4.8/5 from 12,000+ orders<small>Studios, gyms &amp; schools nationwide</small></div>\\n    </div>\\n  </div>\\n</section>\\n\\n<div class=\\\"valuebar\\\">\\n  <div class=\\\"wrap\\\">\\n    <ul>\\n      <li><strong>Direct manufacturer</strong>Better gear, lower prices</li>\\n      <li><strong>Bulk pricing</strong>Studio, gym &amp; event quantities</li>\\n      <li><strong>Fast shipping</strong>Most orders ship in 1 business day</li>\\n      <li><strong>Trusted since 1999</strong>Serving the yoga community 25+ years</li>\\n    </ul>\\n  </div>\\n</div>\\n\\n<section>\\n  <div class=\\\"wrap\\\">\\n    <h2 class=\\\"section-title\\\">Featured Products</h2>\\n    <p class=\\\"section-sub\\\">Our best-selling mats and props, chosen by studios and home practitioners alike.</p>\\n    <div class=\\\"grid-4\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"thumb\\\"><img src=\\\"/images/product-deluxe-mat.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"Deluxe 1/4 inch yoga mat\\\" loading=\\\"lazy\\\"></div>\\n        <div class=\\\"body\\\">\\n          <h3>Deluxe 1/4\\\" Yoga Mat</h3>\\n          <div class=\\\"rating\\\">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733; 1,240 reviews</div>\\n          <div class=\\\"price\\\">$21.95 <s>$27.95</s></div>\\n          <a class=\\\"btn btn-primary\\\" href=\\\"/yoga-mats/deluxe\\\">Add to Cart</a>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"thumb\\\"><img src=\\\"/images/product-foam-block.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"Foam yoga block\\\" loading=\\\"lazy\\\"></div>\\n        <div class=\\\"body\\\">\\n          <h3>Supportive Foam Yoga Block</h3>\\n          <div class=\\\"rating\\\">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733; 860 reviews</div>\\n          <div class=\\\"price\\\">$7.95</div>\\n          <a class=\\\"btn btn-primary\\\" href=\\\"/yoga-blocks/foam\\\">Add to Cart</a>\\n    