\\"wrap hero-inner\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"hero-copy\\\">\\n      <h1>Yoga mats &amp; props for studios, events, and every practice</h1>\\n      <p>We manufacture and source our own goods, so you get high-quality gear at amazing prices &mdash; by the piece or by the pallet.</p>\\n      <a class=\\\"btn\\\" href=\\\"/shop\\\">Shop All Products</a>\\n      <a class=\\\"btn btn-outline\\\" href=\\\"/wholesale\\\">Get Wholesale Pricing</a>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\\\"hero-img\\\"><div>Yoga mats &amp; props</div></div>\\n  </div>\\n</section>\\n\\n<section>\\n  <div class=\\\"wrap\\\">\\n    <h2 class=\\\"section-title\\\">Featured Products</h2>\\n    <p class=\\\"section-sub\\\">Best sellers loved by studios, teachers, and home practitioners.</p>\\n    <div class=\\\"grid\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"ph\\\">Classic Yoga Mat</div>\\n        <h3>Classic Sticky Yoga Mat</h3>\\n        <p class=\\\"price\\\">From $16.95</p>\\n        <a class=\\\"btn\\\" href=\\\"/yoga-mats\\\">Shop Mats</a>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"ph\\\">Foam Yoga Block</div>\\n        <h3>High-Density Foam Block</h3>\\n        <p class=\\\"price\\\">From $6.95</p>\\n        <a class=\\\"btn\\\" href=\\\"/yoga-blocks\\\">Shop Blocks</a>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"ph\\\">Cotton Yoga Strap</div>\\n        <h3>8&#39; Cotton Yoga Strap</h3>\\n        <p class=\\\"price\\\">From $4.95</p>\\n        <a class=\\\"btn\\\" href=\\\"/yoga-straps\\\">Shop Straps</a>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"ph\\\">Studio Package</div>\\n        <h3>Complete Studio Package</h3>\\n        <p class=\\\"price\\\">Bulk pricing</p>\\n        <a class=\\\"btn\\\" href=\\\"/studio-packages\\\">Shop Packages</a>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n  </div>\\n</section>\\n\\n<section class=\\\"testimonials HDLmClassAA93AA83\\\" aria-labelledby=\\\"testimonials-heading\\\">\\n  <div class=\\\"wrap\\\">\\n    <h2 class=\\\"section-title\\\" id=\\\"testimonials-heading\\\">What Our Customers Say</h2>\\n    <p class=\\\"section-sub\\\">Rated 4.8 out of 5 by studio owners, retail buyers, and event organizers across the country.</p>\\n    <div class=\\\"t-grid\\\">\\n      <figure class=\\\"t-card\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"stars\\\" role=\\\"img\\\" aria-label=\\\"Rated 5 out of 5 stars\\\">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</div>\\n        <blockquote class=\\\"t-quote\\\">&ldquo;We outfitted all 42 spots in our studio with YogaDirect mats, blocks, and straps. Three years later they still look and grip like new, and the studio pricing kept us well under budget.&rdquo;</blockquote>\\n        <figcaption>\\n          <p class=\\\"t-name\\\">Marisa Delgado</p>\\n          <p class=\\\"t-role\\\">Studio Owner, Riverbend Yoga &middot; Austin, TX</p>\\n        </figcaption>\\n      </figure>\\n      <figure class=\\\"t-card\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"stars\\\" role=\\\"img\\\" aria-label=\\\"Rated 5 out of 5 stars\\\">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</div>\\n        <blockquote class=\\\"t-quote\\\">&ldquo;As a retail buyer I need consistent quality and margins I can count on. YogaDirect ships accurate, on time, and their props are our highest-turn category every quarter.&rdquo;</blockquote>\\n        <figcaption>\\n          <p class=\\\"t-name\\\">Kevin Nakamura</p>\\n          <p class=\\\"t-role\\\">Retail Buyer, Northwest Wellness Outfitters</p>\\n        </figcaption>\\n      </figure>\\n      <figure class=\\\"t-card\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"stars\\\" role=\\\"img\\\" aria-label=\\\"Rated 4.5 out of 5 stars\\\">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9734;</div>\\n        <blockquote class=\\\"t-quote\\\">&ldquo;I ordered 800 mats for an outdoor festival with a tight deadline. The team confirmed stock the same day and everything arrived early &mdash; they are now our go-to supplier for every event.&rdquo;</blockquote>\\n        <figcaption>\\n          <p class=\\\"t-name\\\">Priya Raman</p>\\n          <p class=\\\"t-role\\\">Event Organizer, Sunrise Flow Festival</p>\\n        </figcaption>\\n      </figure>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\\\"t-cta\\\">\\n      <a class=\\\"btn\\\" href=\\\"/wholesale\\\">Request Studio &amp; Bulk Pricing</a>\\n    </div>\\n  </div>\\n</section>\\n\\n<section class=\\\"about\\\">\\n  <div class=\\\"wrap\\\">\\n    <p>Thanks to our loyal customers, YogaDirect has become one of the largest suppliers of yoga mats and props in the country. We have been faithfully supplying the Yoga community since 1999 and are confident that we can help you grow your studio, event, or personal practice with everything you need and more. We manufacture and source our own goods which is how we can consistently offer high-quality yoga gear at amazing prices. When you shop at YogaDirect, feel proud in knowing that you are helping to grow not only your business or personal practice but the Yoga community as a whole. From our team of Yoga lovers to you, thank you.</p>\\n  </div>\\n</section>\\n\\n<footer>\\n  <div class=\\\"wrap foot-grid\\\">\\n    <div>\\n      <h4>Shop</h4>\\n      <ul>\\n        <li><a href=\\\"/yoga-mats\\\">Yoga Mats</a></li>\\n        <li><a href=\\\"/yoga-blocks\\\">Blocks &amp; Wedges</a></li>\\n        <li><a href=\\\"/bolsters\\\">Bolsters</a></li>\\n        <li><a href=\\\"/sale\\\">Sale</a></li>\\n      </ul>\\n    </div>\\n    <div>\\n      <h4>Wholesale</h4>\\n      <ul>\\n        <li><a href=\\\"/wholesale\\\">Studio &amp; Bulk Pricing</a></li>\\n        <li><a href=\\\"/studio-packages\\\">Studio Packages</a></li>\\n        <li><a href=\\\"/events\\\">Event Orders</a></li>\\n      </ul>\\n    </div>\\n    <div>\\n      <h4>Help</h4>\\n      <ul>\\n        <li><a href=\\\"/contact\\\">Contact Us</a></li>\\n        <li><a href=\\\"/shipping\\\">Shipping</a></li>\\n        <li><a href=\\\"/returns\\\">Returns</a></li>\\n      </ul>\\n    </div>\\n  