ts\\\">Shop Best-Selling Mats</a><a class=\\\"btn btn-outline\\\" href=\\\"#bulk-quote\\\">Buying 10+? Get a Bulk Quote</a></div></div></section><div class=\\\"wrap\\\"><div class=\\\"trust\\\"><div>Trusted by thousands of studios since 1999</div><div>Volume pricing on 10+ units</div><div>Ships from our own warehouse</div><div>Easy returns</div></div></div><section><div class=\\\"wrap\\\"><h2 class=\\\"sec\\\">Featured Products</h2><p class=\\\"seclead\\\">Customer favorites &mdash; every item is available at volume pricing for studios and events.</p><div class=\\\"grid\\\"><div class=\\\"card\\\"><div class=\\\"thumb\\\"></div><h3>Classic Sticky Yoga Mat</h3><p class=\\\"price\\\">$19.95</p><p class=\\\"bulknote\\\">Save more at 10+ &mdash; ask for a bulk quote</p><a class=\\\"btn btn-primary btn-sm\\\" href=\\\"/classic-sticky-mat\\\">Add to Cart</a></div><div class=\\\"card\\\"><div class=\\\"thumb\\\"></div><h3>Extra Thick Deluxe Mat</h3><p class=\\\"price\\\">$29.95</p><p class=\\\"bulknote\\\">Save more at 10+ &mdash; ask for a bulk quote</p><a class=\\\"btn btn-primary btn-sm\\\" href=\\\"/deluxe-mat\\\">Add to Cart</a></div><div class=\\\"card\\\"><div class=\\\"thumb\\\"></div><h3>Foam Yoga Block</h3><p class=\\\"price\\\">$7.95</p><p class=\\\"bulknote\\\">Save more at 10+ &mdash; ask for a bulk quote</p><a class=\\\"btn btn-primary btn-sm\\\" href=\\\"/foam-block\\\">Add to Cart</a></div><div class=\\\"card\\\"><div class=\\\"thumb\\\"></div><h3>Cotton Yoga Strap</h3><p class=\\\"price\\\">$5.95</p><p class=\\\"bulknote\\\">Save more at 10+ &mdash; ask for a bulk quote</p><a class=\\\"btn btn-primary btn-sm\\\" href=\\\"/yoga-strap\\\">Add to Cart</a></div><div class=\\\"card\\\"><div class=\\\"thumb\\\"></div><h3>Supportive Yoga Bolster</h3><p class=\\\"price\\\">$34.95</p><p class=\\\"bulknote\\\">Save more at 10+ &mdash; ask for a bulk quote</p><a class=\\\"btn btn-primary btn-sm\\\" href=\\\"/bolster\\\">Add to Cart</a></div><div class=\\\"card\\\"><div class=\\\"thumb\\\"></div><h3>Mexican Yoga Blanket</h3><p class=\\\"price\\\">$16.95</p><p class=\\\"bulknote\\\">Save more at 10+ &mdash; ask for a bulk quote</p><a class=\\\"btn btn-primary btn-sm\\\" href=\\\"/yoga-blanket\\\">Add to Cart</a></div></div></div></section><section class=\\\"bulk HDLmClassE876E246\\\" id=\\\"bulk-quote\\\"><div class=\\\"wrap inner\\\"><div><h2>Outfitting a studio, gym, school or event? Get wholesale pricing.</h2><p class=\\\"lead\\\">Because we manufacture and source our own goods, we can quote sharper prices on volume orders &mdash; mats, blocks, straps, bolsters, blankets and full studio packages.</p><ul><li>Tiered discounts starting at 10 units, deeper savings at 50, 100 and 500+</li><li>Mix and match products on one purchase order</li><li>Custom colors and logo branding available</li><li>Freight quotes, drop-shipping and school/PO billing supported</li><li>A real person as your dedicated account contact</li></ul><div class=\\\"promise\\\">Our promise: every bulk quote request gets a personal reply within 1 business day (Mon&ndash;Fri).</div><div class=\\\"callnow\\\">Prefer to talk it through? Call our wholesale team:<!-- Replace the placeholder number below with YogaDirect's live wholesale line --><a href=\\\"tel:+18005550199\\\">1-800-555-0199</a></div></div><div class=\\\"quotebox\\\"><h3>Request a Free Bulk Quote</h3><p class=\\\"sub\\\">No obligation, no account needed. Takes about 30 seconds.</p><form class=\\\"f\\\" action=\\\"/bulk-quote-request\\\" method=\\\"post\\\"><div class=\\\"f2\\\"><div><label for=\\\"bq-name\\\">Name</label><input id=\\\"bq-name\\\" name=\\\"name\\\" type=\\\"text\\\" required placeholder=\\\"Jane Smith\\\"></div><div><label for=\\\"bq-org\\\">Studio / Organization</label><input id=\\\"bq-org\\\" name=\\\"organization\\\" type=\\\"text\\\" placeholder=\\\"Riverbend Yoga\\\"></div></div><div class=\\\"f2\\\"><div><label for=\\\"bq-email\\\">Email</label><input id=\\\"bq-email\\\" name=\\\"email\\\" type=\\\"email\\\" required placeholder=\\\"you@studio.com\\\"></div><div><label for=\\\"bq-phone\\\">Phone</label><input id=\\\"bq-phone\\\" name=\\\"phone\\\" type=\\\"tel\\\" placeholder=\\\"(555) 123-4567\\\"></div></div><div class=\\\"f2\\\"><div><label for=\\\"bq-type\\\">Buyer type</label><select id=\\\"bq-type\\\" name=\\\"buyer_type\\\"><option>Yoga studio</option><option>Gym / fitness center</option><option>School / university</option><option>Corporate / event</option><option>Retailer / reseller</option><option>Other</option></select></div><div><label for=\\\"bq-qty\\\">Estimated quantity</label><select id=\\\"bq-qty\\\" name=\\\"quantity\\\"><option>10&ndash;24</option><option>25&ndash;49</option><option>50&ndash;99</option><option>100&ndash;499</option><option>500+</option></select></div></div><div><label for=\\\"bq-items\\\">What do you need a quote on?</label><textarea id=\\\"bq-items\\\" name=\\\"items\\\" rows=\\\"3\\\" placeholder=\\\"e.g. 40 deluxe mats, 40 blocks, 20 straps &mdash; needed by Sept 1\\\"></textarea></div><button class=\\\"btn btn-primary\\\" type=\\\"submit\\\">Request a Free Bulk Quote</button><p class=\\\"fineprint\\\">We reply within 1 business day. We only use your details to prepare your quote &mdash; no spam, unsubscribe anytime.</p></form></div></div></section><section class=\\\"about\\\"><div class=\\\"wrap\\\"><h2 class=\\\"sec\\\">Supplying the yoga community since 1999</h2><p>Thanks to our loyal customers, YogaDirect has become one of the largest suppliers of yoga mats and props in the country. We have been faithfully supplying the Yoga community since 1999 and are confident that we can help you grow your studio, event, or personal practice with everything you need and more. We manufacture and source our own goods which is how we can consistently offer high-quality yoga gear at amazing prices. When you shop at YogaDirect, feel proud in knowing that you are helping to grow not only your business or personal practice but the Yoga community as a whole. From our team of Yoga lovers to you, thank you.</p><a class=\\\"btn btn-outline\\\" href=\\\"#bulk-quote\\\">Talk to our wholesale team</a></div></section><footer class=\\\"site\\\"><div class=\\\"wrap fgrid\\\"><div><h4>Shop</h4><a href=\\\"/yoga-mats\\\">Yoga Mats</a><a href=\\\"/yoga-props\\\">Props</a><a href=\\\"/studio-packages\\\">Studio Packages</a><a href=\\\"/sale\\\">Sale</a></div><div><h4>Wholesale</h4><a href=\\\"#bulk-quote\\\">Request a Free Bulk Quote</a><a href=\\\"#bulk-quote\\\">Volume Pricing Tiers</a><a href=\\\"#bulk-quote\\\">Custom Branding</a></div><div><h4>Help</h4><a href=\\\"/shipping\\\">Shipping</a><a href=\\\"/returns\\\">Returns</a><a href=\\\"/contact\\\">Contact Us</a></div><div><h4>Wholesale Team</h4><a href=\\\"tel:+18005550199\\\">1-800-555-0199</a><span>Mon&ndash;Fri, 9am&ndash;5pm</span></div></div><div class=\\\"wrap\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:18px\\\">&copy; YogaDirect. Supplying the yoga community since 1999.</div></footer></body></html>\",\"improvements\":[{\"What\":\"Added a bulk/wholesale lead-capture block with a \\\"Request a Free Bulk Quote\\\" CTA, response-time promise and phone number.\",\"Why\":\"Bulk buyers need pricing before ordering, so a quote CTA plus fast response promise and phone number captures high-value leads.\",\"Hash\":\"HDLmClassE876E246\"}]}","refusal":null,"reasoning":"I'm going to retrieve that URL.The fetch is returning plain text instead of HTML, so I'll construct the HTML myself. I need to add a bulk/wholesale lead-capture section with a \"Request a Free Bulk Quote\" button, a response-time guarantee, and a phone number. Let me compute the DJB2 hash for this change. I'm refining the strings to make them shorter and more manageable for hand-computing the DJB2 hash. I've trimmed the Why statement down to around 125 characters, bringing the total to about 245 characters, which is still lengthy but more feasible to work through methodically. Now I'm preparing to wr