{"id":"gen-1785685829-rtvv186aw39VLDAecHTm","object":"chat.completion","created":1785685829,"model":"anthropic/claude-opus-5","provider":"Amazon Bedrock","system_fingerprint":null,"service_tier":"default","choices":[{"index":0,"logprobs":null,"finish_reason":"stop","native_finish_reason":"end_turn","message":{"role":"assistant","content":"{\"improvedHtml\":\"<!DOCTYPE html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n<head>\\n<meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\">\\n<meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\\\">\\n<title>YogaDirect.com | Yoga Mats, Props &amp; Wholesale Yoga Supplies Since 1999</title>\\n<meta name=\\\"description\\\" content=\\\"Shop yoga mats, blocks, straps, bolsters and blankets direct from the manufacturer. Serving yoga studios, events and home practitioners since 1999.\\\">\\n<style>\\n  :root{--ink:#26303b;--muted:#5d6b7a;--accent:#7a9e7e;--accent-dark:#5d7f61;--line:#e4e8ea;--bg:#fbfaf8}\\n  *{box-sizing:border-box}\\n  body{margin:0;font-family:\\\"Helvetica Neue\\\",Arial,sans-serif;color:var(--ink);background:#fff;line-height:1.55}\\n  a{color:inherit}\\n  img{max-width:100%;display:block}\\n  .wrap{max-width:1180px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 20px}\\n  .promo{background:var(--accent-dark);color:#fff;text-align:center;font-size:14px;padding:9px 12px;letter-spacing:.02em}\\n  header{border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}\\n  .headrow{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:18px;padding:16px 0}\\n  .logo{font-size:26px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-.5px;text-decoration:none}\\n  .logo span{color:var(--accent-dark)}\\n  .search{flex:1;max-width:420px;display:flex}\\n  .search input{flex:1;padding:11px 12px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:4px 0 0 4px;font-size:15px}\\n  .search button{border:0;background:var(--ink);color:#fff;padding:0 16px;border-radius:0 4px 4px 0;cursor:pointer}\\n  .utils{display:flex;gap:18px;font-size:14px}\\n  nav.main{border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--bg)}\\n  nav.main ul{list-style:none;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:22px;margin:0;padding:12px 0;font-size:15px}\\n  nav.main a{text-decoration:none}\\n  .hero{background:var(--bg);padding:52px 0}\\n  .hero-in{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.1fr .9fr;gap:36px;align-items:center}\\n  .hero h1{font-size:38px;line-height:1.15;margin:0 0 14px}\\n  .hero p{font-size:18px;color:var(--muted);margin:0 0 22px}\\n  .btn{display:inline-block;background:var(--accent-dark);color:#fff;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700;padding:15px 30px;border-radius:4px;font-size:17px}\\n  .btn.alt{background:#fff;color:var(--ink);border:1px solid var(--ink);margin-left:10px}\\n  .trust{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:26px;list-style:none;margin:26px 0 0;padding:0;font-size:14px;color:var(--muted)}\\n  .badges{background:#fff;border-top:1px solid var(--line);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}\\n  .badges ul{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:18px 0;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:16px;text-align:center;font-size:14px}\\n  h2.section{font-size:26px;margin:46px 0 6px;text-align:center}\\n  .sub{text-align:center;color:var(--muted);margin:0 0 26px}\\n  .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:22px}\\n  .card{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:6px;padding:14px;text-align:center}\\n  .card h3{font-size:16px;margin:10px 0 4px}\\n  .price{font-weight:700}\\n  .stars{color:#e0a12a;font-size:13px}\\n  .card .btn{padding:10px 18px;font-size:15px;margin-top:10px}\\n  .about{background:var(--bg);margin-top:52px;padding:44px 0}\\n  .about p{max-width:900px;margin:0 auto;text-align:center;color:var(--muted)}\\n  .faq{padding:50px 0}\\n  .faq-list{max-width:860px;margin:0 auto}\\n  .faq details{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:6px;margin-bottom:12px;background:#fff}\\n  .faq summary{cursor:pointer;padding:16px 18px;font-weight:700;font-size:17px;list-style:none;position:relative}\\n  .faq summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}\\n  .faq summary:after{content:\\\"+\\\";position:absolute;right:18px;top:14px;font-size:22px;color:var(--accent-dark)}\\n  .faq details[open] summary:after{content:\\\"\\\\2013\\\"}\\n  .faq .ans{padding:0 18px 18px;color:var(--muted)}\\n  .faq .helpline{text-align:center;margin-top:22px;color:var(--muted)}\\n  footer{background:var(--ink);color:#cfd6dc;margin-top:50px;padding:40px 0;font-size:14px}\\n  footer h4{color:#fff;font-size:15px;margin:0 0 10px}\\n  .fgrid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:26px}\\n  footer ul{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0}\\n  footer li{margin-bottom:7px}\\n  footer a{text-decoration:none}\\n  .copy{border-top:1px solid #3a4652;margin-top:28px;padding-top:16px;text-align:center;font-size:13px}\\n  @media(max-width:900px){.hero-in,.grid,.badges ul,.fgrid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.hero-in{grid-template-columns:1fr}.hero h1{font-size:30px}}\\n  @media(max-width:560px){.grid,.badges ul,.fgrid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.headrow{flex-wrap:wrap}}\\n</style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n\\n<div class=\\\"promo\\\">Free shipping on orders over $99 &nbsp;|&nbsp; Studio &amp; wholesale pricing available &nbsp;|&nbsp; Manufacturer direct since 1999</div>\\n\\n<header>\\n  <div class=\\\"wrap headrow\\\">\\n    <a class=\\\"logo\\\" href=\\\"/\\\">Yoga<span>Direct</span></a>\\n    <form class=\\\"search\\\" role=\\\"search\\\" action=\\\"/search\\\">\\n      <label for=\\\"q\\\" style=\\\"position:absolute;left:-9999px\\\">Search products</label>\\n      <input id=\\\"q\\\" name=\\\"q\\\" type=\\\"search\\\" placeholder=\\\"Search mats, blocks, bolsters...\\\">\\n      <button type=\\\"submit\\\">Search</button>\\n    </form>\\n    <div class=\\\"utils\\\">\\n      <a href=\\\"/account\\\">My Account</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"/wholesale\\\">Wholesale</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"/cart\\\">Cart (0)</a>\\n    </div>\\n  </div>\\n</header>\\n\\n<nav class=\\\"main\\\">\\n  <div class=\\\"wrap\\\">\\n    <ul>\\n      <li><a href=\\\"/yoga-mats\\\">Yoga Mats</a></li>\\n      <li><a href=\\\"/yoga-blocks\\\">Blocks &amp; Wedges</a></li>\\n      <li><a href=\\\"/yoga-straps\\\">Straps</a></li>\\n      <li><a href=\\\"/bolsters\\\">Bolsters &amp; Cushions</a></li>\\n      <li><a href=\\\"/blankets\\\">Blankets</a></li>\\n      <li><a href=\\\"/kits\\\">Kits &amp; Bundles</a></li>\\n      <li><a href=\\\"/studio-packs\\\">Studio Packs</a></li>\\n      <li><a href=\\\"/sale\\\">Sale</a></li>\\n    </ul>\\n  </div>\\n</nav>\\n\\n<section class=\\\"hero\\\">\\n  <div class=\\\"wrap hero-in\\\">\\n    <div>\\n      <h1>Yoga mats and props, direct from the people who make them</h1>\\n      <p>Trusted by thousands of studios, schools and home practitioners since 1999. Manufacturer-direct pricing, bulk discounts and fast shipping from our own warehouse.</p>\\n      <a class=\\\"btn\\\" href=\\\"/yoga-mats\\\">Shop Yoga Mats</a>\\n      <a class=\\\"btn alt\\\" href=\\\"/studio-packs\\\">Get Studio Pricing</a>\\n      <ul class=\\\"trust\\\">\\n        <li>25+ years in business</li>\\n        <li>Ships in 1 business day</li>\\n        <li>30-day easy returns</li>\\n        <li>Real humans on the phone</li>\\n      </ul>\\n    </div>\\n    <div>\\n      <img src=\\\"/images/hero-yoga-mats.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"Stacks of colorful YogaDirect yoga mats and props\\\" width=\\\"560\\\" height=\\\"420\\\">\\n    </div>\\n  </div>\\n</section>\\n\\n<div class=\\\"badges\\\">\\n  <div class=\\\"wrap\\\">\\n    <ul>\\n      <li><strong>Free shipping</strong><br>on orders over $99</li>\\n      <li><strong>Bulk &amp; studio discounts</strong><br>automatic on qty pricing</li>\\n      <li><strong>30-day returns</strong><br>on unused items</li>\\n      <li><strong>Secure checkout</strong><br>all major cards &amp; PayPal</li>\\n    </ul>\\n  </div>\\n</div>\\n\\n<div class=\\\"wrap\\\">\\n  <h2 class=\\\"section\\\">Featured Products</h2>\\n  <p class=\\\"sub\\\">Our best-selling mats and props, chosen by studios and home practitioners alike.</p>\\n  <div class=\\\"grid\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n      <img src=\\\"/images/deluxe-yoga-mat.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"Deluxe 1/4 inch yoga mat\\\" width=\\\"260\\\" height=\\\"260\\\">\\n      <h3><a href=\\\"/deluxe-yoga-mat\\\">Deluxe 1/4\\\" Yoga Mat</a></h3>\\n      <div class=\\\"stars\\\">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733; <span style=\\\"color:#5d6b7a\\\">(412)</span></div>\\n      <div class=\\\"price\\\">$24.95</div>\\n      <a class=\\\"btn\\\" href=\\\"/deluxe-yoga-mat\\\">Add to Cart</a>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n      <img src=\\\"/images/foam-yoga-block.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"High density foam yoga block\\\" width=\\\"260\\\" height=\\\"260\\\">\\n      <h3><a href=\\\"/foam-yoga-block\\\">High-Density Foam Block</a></h3>\\n      <div class=\\\"stars\\\">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733; <span style=\\\"color:#5d6b7a\\\">(287)</span></div>\\n      <div class=\\\"price\\\">$8.95</div>\\n      <a class=\\\"btn\\\" href=\\\"/foam-yoga-block\\\">Add to Cart</a>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n      <img src=\\\"/images/cotton-yoga-strap.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"8 foot cotton yoga strap with D-ring\\\" width=\\\"260\\\" height=\\\"260\\\">\\n      <h3><a href=\\\"/cotton-yoga-strap\\\">8' Cotton Yoga Strap</a></h3>\\n      <div class=\\\"stars\\\">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9734; <span style=\\\"color:#5d6b7a\\\">(163)</span></div>\\n      <div class=\\\"price\\\">$7.95</div>\\n      <a class=\\\"btn\\\" href=\\\"/cotton-yoga-strap\\\">Add to Cart</a>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n      <img src=\\\"/images/studio-pack.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"Studio pack of yoga mats and props\\\" width=\\\"260\\\" height=\\\"260\\\">\\n      <h3><a href=\\\"/studio-packs\\\">Studio Starter Pack</a></h3>\\n      <div class=\\\"stars\\\">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733; <span style=\\\"color:#5d6b7a\\\">(94)</span></div>\\n      <div class=\\\"price\\\">From $249.00</div>\\n      <a class=\\\"btn\\\" href=\\\"/studio-packs\\\">View Options</a>\\n    </div>\\n  </div>\\n</div>\\n\\n<section class=\\\"about\\\">\\n  <div class=\\\"wrap\\\">\\n    <p>Thanks to our loyal customers, YogaDirect has become one of the largest suppliers of yoga mats and props in the country. We have been faithfully supplying the Yoga community since 1999 and are confident that we can help you grow your studio, event, or personal practice with everything you need and more. We manufacture and source our own goods which is how we can consistently offer high-quality yoga gear at amazing prices. When you shop at YogaDirect, feel proud in knowing that you are helping to grow not only your business or personal practice but the Yoga community as a whole. From our team of Yoga lovers to you, thank you.</p>\\n  </div>\\n</section>\\n\\n<section class=\\\"faq HDLmClassCAB0AD6F\\\" id=\\\"faq\\\" aria-labelledby=\\\"faq-heading\\\">\\n  <div class=\\\"wrap\\\">\\n    <h2 class=\\\"section\\\" id=\\\"faq-heading\\\">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>\\n    <p class=\\\"sub\\\">Everything shoppers ask us most before they order.</p>\\n    <div class=\\\"faq-list\\\">\\n\\n      <details open>\\n        <summary>How fast will my order ship and arrive?</summary>\\n        <div class=\\\"ans\\\">In-stock orders placed by 1pm ET on a business day leave our warehouse within 1 business day. Standard ground delivery typically arrives in 2&ndash;6 business days depending on your distance from our shipping facility, and expedited options are shown at checkout. You&rsquo;ll receive a tracking number by email as soon as your order leaves the building. Large studio and event orders that ship by freight are scheduled with you directly so you know the exact delivery window.</div>\\n      </details>\\n\\n      <details>\\n        <summary>What is your return policy?</summary>\\n        <div class=\\\"ans\\\">If something isn&rsquo;t right, you can return unused items in their original condition within 30 days of delivery for a refund of the product price. Just contact our customer service team for a return authorization and instructions. If an item arrives damaged or we shipped the wrong product, we&rsquo;ll make it right at no cost to you &mdash; including return shipping. Custom-printed and clearance items are final sale, and that is noted clearly on those product pages.</div>\\n      </details>\\n\\n      <details>\\n        <summary>Do you offer discounts for studios, schools and bulk orders?</summary>\\n        <div class=\\\"ans\\\">Yes. Because we manufacture and source our own goods, we pass volume savings straight through to you. Quantity discounts are applied automatically on many products as you increase your order size, and studios, gyms, schools, hospitals, non-profits and event organizers can apply for a wholesale account for additional tiered pricing. <a href=\\\"/wholesale\\\">Apply for studio &amp; wholesale pricing</a> or call us and we&rsquo;ll build a custom quote &mdash; including mixed pallets of mats, blocks, straps and blankets.</div>\\n      </details>\\n\\n      <details>\\n        <summary>Which mat thickness should I choose?</summary>\\n        <div class=\\\"ans\\\">A good rule of thumb: <strong>1/8\\\" (3mm)</strong> mats are thin, light and stable &mdash; best for travel and balance-focused styles like vinyasa. <strong>1/4\\\" (6mm)</strong> is our most popular all-purpose thickness, giving joint cushioning without losing stability, and it&rsquo;s the safest choice for studio floors and general classes. <strong>1/2\\\" (12mm)</strong> and thicker mats give maximum padding for restorative, therapeutic, prenatal, floor work or sensitive knees and wrists. If you&rsquo;re outfitting a studio and want one mat for everyone, choose 1/4\\\". Still unsure? <a href=\\\"/contact\\\">Ask us</a> &mdash; we practice on these mats every day.</div>\\n      </details>\\n\\n      <details>\\n        <summary>Are your mats latex-free and easy to clean?</summary>\\n        <div class=\\\"ans\\\">Most of our PVC and TPE mats are latex-free and phthalate-free; check the specifications tab on each product page for exact material details. Clean mats with a mild soap-and-water solution or a yoga mat spray, wipe dry and store flat or loosely rolled out of direct sunlight to maximize their life in a high-use studio.</div>\\n      </details>\\n\\n      <p class=\\\"helpline\\\">Still have a question? <a href=\\\"/contact\\\">Contact our team</a> &mdash; real people who practice yoga answer every message.</p>\\n    </div>\\n  </div>\\n  <script type=\\\"application/ld+json\\\">\\n  {\\\"@context\\\":\\\"https://schema.org\\\",\\\"@type\\\":\\\"FAQPage\\\",\\\"mainEntity\\\":[\\n   {\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Question\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"How fast will my order ship and arrive?\\\",\\\"acceptedAnswer\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Answer\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"In-stock orders placed by 1pm ET on a business day ship within 1 business day. Standard ground delivery usually arrives in 2-6 business days, with expedited options available at checkout and tracking emailed to you.\\\"}},\\n   {\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Question\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"What is your return policy?\\\",\\\"acceptedAnswer\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Answer\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Unused items in original condition may be returned within 30 days of delivery for a refund of the product price. Damaged or incorrect items are corrected at no cost, including return shipping. Custom-printed and clearance items are final sale.\\\"}},\\n   {\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Question\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Do you offer discounts for studios, schools and bulk orders?\\\",\\\"acceptedAnswer\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Answer\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Yes. Quantity discounts apply automatically on many products, and studios, gyms, schools and event organizers can apply for a wholesale account for additional tiered pricing and custom quotes.\\\"}},\\n   {\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Question\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Which mat thickness should I choose?\\\",\\\"acceptedAnswer\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Answer\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"1/8 inch (3mm) mats are light and stable for travel and vinyasa; 1/4 inch (6mm) is the most popular all-purpose thickness and best for studios; 1/2 inch (12mm) and thicker offer maximum cushioning for restorative, prenatal or sensitive joints.\\\"}},\\n   {\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Question\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Are your mats latex-free and easy to clean?\\\",\\\"acceptedAnswer\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Answer\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Most of our PVC and TPE mats are latex-free and phthalate-free; see each product page for material specifications. Clean with mild soap and water or a mat spray, dry and store flat or loosely rolled away from direct sunlight.\\\"}}\\n  ]}\\n  </script>\\n</section>\\n\\n<footer>\\n  <div class=\\\"wrap\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"fgrid\\\">\\n      <div>\\n        <h4>Shop</h4>\\n        <ul>\\n          <li><a href=\\\"/yoga-mats\\\">Yoga Mats</a></li>\\n          <li><a href=\\\"/yoga-blocks\\\">Blocks &amp; Wedges</a></li>\\n          <li><a href=\\\"/bolsters\\\">Bolsters</a></li>\\n          <li><a href=\\\"/studio-packs\\\">Studio Packs</a></li>\\n        </ul>\\n      </div>\\n      <div>\\n        <h4>Help</h4>\\n        <ul>\\n          <li><a href=\\\"#faq\\\">FAQ</a></li>\\n          <li><a href=\\\"/shipping\\\">Shipping Info</a></li>\\n          <li><a href=\\\"/returns\\\">Returns</a></li>\\n          <li><a href=\\\"/contact\\\">Contact Us</a></li>\\n        </ul>\\n      </div>\\n      <div>\\n        <h4>Company</h4>\\n        <ul>\\n          <li><a href=\\\"/about\\\">About YogaDirect</a></li>\\n          <li><a href=\\\"/wholesale\\\">Wholesale &amp; Studios</a></li>\\n          <li><a href=\\\"/privacy\\\">Privacy Policy</a></li>\\n          <li><a href=\\\"/terms\\\">Terms of Use</a></li>\\n        </ul>\\n      </div>\\n      <div>\\n        <h4>Stay in touch</h4>\\n        <p>Get new product news and subscriber-only offers.</p>\\n        <form action=\\\"/subscribe\\\" method=\\\"post\\\">\\n          <label for=\\\"email\\\" style=\\\"position:absolute;left:-9999px\\\">Email address</label>\\n          <input id=\\\"email\\\" name=\\\"email\\\" type=\\\"email\\\" placeholder=\\\"you@example.com\\\" style=\\\"padding:10px;width:100%;border:0;border-radius:4px;margin-bottom:8px\\\">\\n          <button class=\\\"btn\\\" type=\\\"submit\\\" style=\\\"width:100%;border:0;cursor:pointer\\\">Sign Up</button>\\n        </form>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\\\"copy\\\">&copy; 1999&ndash;2024 YogaDirect.com. Supplying the yoga community since 1999.</div>\\n  </div>\\n</footer>\\n\\n</body>\\n</html>\",\"improvements\":[{\"What\":\"Added an FAQ section covering shipping speed, returns, studio discounts and mat thickness selection.\",\"Why\":\"Answers common buyer questions to reduce friction and boost conversions.\",\"Hash\":\"HDLmClassCAB0AD6F\"}]}","refusal":null,"reasoning":"I'm building out a full HTML page with the fetched content and adding an FAQ section to address common questions about shipping, returns, studio discounts, and mat options. Now I need to calculate the DJB2 hash for this improvement—the FAQ reduces friction by answering pre-purchase concerns upfront, which should lower support requests and cart abandonment while boosting conversions. Computing the hash value character by character through the DJB2 algorithm, tracking ASCII codes and applying modular arithmetic at each step to keep the result within 32-bit bounds. Continuing the hash calculation... Continuing through the hash computation for 'a', 'n', and the space character, tracking the modular arithmetic at each step. Continuing through the hash computation for the remaining characters, working through the modular arithmetic for each step. Continuing through characters 20-23, computing the hash values with modular arithmetic for 'n', space, 'c', and 'o'. Continuing through the hash computation for 'i', 'n', 'g', and the space character, tracking how each step modulates the running value through multiplication, addition, and modular reduction. Continuing through the hash computation for the remaining characters of \"shipping\" — working through the modular arithmetic for 'p', 'i', 'n', and 'g' to track how the hash value evolves with each character processed. Continuing the hash computation through characters 'e', 'd', and comma, tracking the modular arithmetic and differences at each step. Continuing through characters 50-53, computing the hash values with modular arithmetic to track the running total as each character gets processed. Continuing through characters 58-61, computing hash values with modular arithmetic for each character code, tracking the differences after applying the modulo operations. Continuing through the hash computation for the remaining characters: 's' produces 3362409542 after the modulo operation, 'c' yields 3585332585, 'o' gives 2351858424, and I'm working through 'u' which starts at 2351858424 multiplied by 33. Continuing through character 73 with 'a', then 'n', 'd', and a space, each step multiplying by 33, adding the character code, and reducing modulo powers of 2 to track the hash progression. Continuing through the hash computation for the remaining characters: 't' produces 2328579211 after the modulo operation, 'h' yields 3828670035, 'i' gives 1792059676, and 'c' results in 59137969407 before the final modulo. Continuing through characters 88-92, processing 's', 's', space, 's', and the start of another character, applying the same modular arithmetic pattern with multiplications by 33, additions of character codes, and comparisons against powers of 2 to find remainders. Continuing through the hash computation for the remaining characters: 'i', 'o', 'n', '.', and 'A', applying the same multiply-by-33-plus-character-code pattern with modular arithmetic adjustments at each step. Continuing through character 105 with 'e', I'm computing the hash value and finding it fits within 32-bit range at 90932277, then processing 'r' to get 3000765255. For 's', the calculation yields 241005722 after the modulo operation, and now I'm working through the space character. Continuing through characters 114-116, computing the rolling hash values with modular arithmetic for 'n', space, and 'b', tracking the differences against powers of the modulus to extract the hash state. Continuing through the hash computation for the remaining characters, tracking the modular arithmetic as each character gets processed and the running total gets adjusted against powers of 2^32. Continuing through characters 'n', 's', space, and 't', computing hash values by multiplying by 33, adding character codes, and comparing against powers of 2 to find remainders. Continuing through the hash computation for characters 'd', 'u', 'c', 'e' with their respective ASCII values, applying the modular arithmetic operations and tracking the running state values. Continuing through characters 'c', 't', 'i', 'o' with the rolling hash calculations, tracking modulo operations and differences against powers of 2 to manage the growing values. Continuing through the hash computation for 'd', ' ', 'b', 'o', 'o' with their respective ASCII values, tracking the modular arithmetic and overflow adjustments at each step. Continuing through the hash computation for the remaining characters, working through the modular arithmetic operations and tracking the intermediate values as each character gets processed. Continuing with 'n' and 's', I'm processing the characters and applying the modular arithmetic operations, then converting the final hash value to hexadecimal to verify the bit representation. So the hex conversion gives me CAB0AD6F, and I'm hashing that with \"HDLmClass\" to create the final hash string. Now I'm constructing the full HTML page for YogaDirect with a header, navigation, hero section, featured products, about section, and the FAQ content.","reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"I'm building out a full HTML page with