iv>\\n</section>\\n\\n<section style=\\\"padding-top:0\\\">\\n  <div class=\\\"wrap\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"sechead\\\"><div><h2>Shop by need</h2><p>Find the right gear in seconds.</p></div></div>\\n    <div class=\\\"catgrid\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"cat\\\">\\n        <h3>Home practice</h3>\\n        <p>Mats, blocks and straps for everyday practice at home.</p>\\n        <a class=\\\"link-more\\\" href=\\\"/home-practice\\\">Shop home essentials &rarr;</a>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"cat\\\">\\n        <h3>Studios &amp; schools</h3>\\n        <p>Durable, easy-clean props in bulk quantities with volume discounts.</p>\\n        <a class=\\\"link-more\\\" href=\\\"/studio-packs\\\">Shop studio packs &rarr;</a>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"cat\\\">\\n        <h3>Events &amp; retreats</h3>\\n        <p>Custom quantities, drop shipping and branding options available.</p>\\n        <a class=\\\"link-more\\\" href=\\\"/events\\\">Request event pricing &rarr;</a>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n  </div>\\n</section>\\n\\n<section style=\\\"padding-top:0\\\">\\n  <div class=\\\"wrap\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"bulk HDLmClass867AE20F\\\">\\n      <div>\\n        <h2>Buying for a studio? Get wholesale pricing.</h2>\\n        <p>Tell us what you need and a real person will send a same-business-day quote with tiered volume discounts, freight options and net terms for qualified studios.</p>\\n        <form action=\\\"/wholesale-quote\\\" method=\\\"post\\\">\\n          <input type=\\\"email\\\" name=\\\"email\\\" placeholder=\\\"Work email\\\" required>\\n          <input type=\\\"text\\\" name=\\\"qty\\\" placeholder=\\\"Items &amp; quantity (e.g. 30 mats)\\\">\\n          <button class=\\\"btn btn-primary\\\" type=\\\"submit\\\">Get My Free Quote</button>\\n        </form>\\n      </div>\\n      <div>\\n        <ul style=\\\"list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0;font-size:15px\\\">\\n          <li style=\\\"margin-bottom:8px\\\">&#10003; Discounts start at just 10 units</li>\\n          <li style=\\\"margin-bottom:8px\\\">&#10003; Dedicated account rep</li>\\n          <li style=\\\"margin-bottom:8px\\\">&#10003; Net-30 terms for qualified studios</li>\\n          <li>&#10003; Free freight quotes on pallet orders</li>\\n        </ul>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n  </div>\\n</section>\\n\\n<section style=\\\"padding-top:0\\\">\\n  <div class=\\\"wrap\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"sechead\\\"><div><h2>What customers say</h2><p>Rated 4.8/5 across 20,000+ verified orders.</p></div></div>\\n    <div class=\\\"quotes\\\">\\n      <blockquote>\\\"Ordered 30 mats for our studio &mdash; great quality for the price and they arrived in two days.\\\"<footer>Megan R., studio owner</footer></blockquote>\\n      <blockquote>\\\"The bolsters are firm and hold their shape. My restorative classes love them.\\\"<footer>Daniel P., instructor</footer></blockquote>\\n      <blockquote>\\\"Same mats we used at our teacher training, at about half the price. Easy reorder.\\\"<footer>Aisha K., home practitioner</footer></blockquote>\\n    </div>\\n  </div>\\n</section>\\n\\n<div class=\\\"email HDLmClass3D691EC5\\\">\\n  <div class=\\\"wrap inner\\\" style=\\\"padding:34px 0\\\">\\n    <div>\\n      <h2>Get 10% off your first order</h2>\\n      <p style=\\\"margin:6px 0 0;color:var(--muted)\\\">Join our list for new product drops, studio pricing alerts and seasonal sales.</p>\\n    </div>\\n    <div>\\n      <form action=\\\"/subscribe\\\" method=\\\"post\\\">\\n        <input type=\\\"email\\\" name=\\\"email\\\" placeholder=\\\"Enter your email address\\\" required aria-label=\\\"Email address\\\">\\n        <button class=\\\"btn btn-primary\\\" type=\\\"submit\\\">Send My 10% Code</button>\\n      </form>\\n      <small>One email a week at most. Unsubscribe anytime. We never share your address.</small>\\n    </div>\\n  </div>\\n</div>\\n\\n<section class=\\\"about\\\">\\n  <div class=\\\"wrap\\\">\\n    <h2>About YogaDirect</h2>\\n    <p>Thanks to our loyal customers, YogaDirect has become one of the largest suppliers of yoga mats and props in the country. We have been faithfully supplying the Yoga community since 1999 and are confident that we can help you grow your studio, event, or personal practice with everything you need and more. We manufacture and source our own goods which is how we can consistently offer high-quality yoga gear at amazing prices. When you shop at YogaDirect, feel proud in knowing that you are helping to grow not only your business or personal practice but the Yoga community as a whole. From our team of Yoga lovers to you, thank you.</p>\\n    <p><a class=\\\"link-more\\\" href=\\\"/yoga-mats\\\">Start shopping yoga mats &rarr;</a></p>\\n  </div>\\n</section>\\n\\n<footer class=\\\"site\\\">\\n  <div class=\\\"wrap\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"cols\\\">\\n      <div>\\n        <h4>Shop</h4>\\n        <ul>\\n          <li><a href=\\\"/yoga-mats\\\">Yoga Mats</a></li>\\n          <li><a href=\\\"/yoga-blocks\\\">Blocks &amp; Wedges</a></li>\\n          <li><a href=\\\"/bolsters\\\">Bolsters</a></li>\\n          <li><a href=\\\"/studio-packs\\\">Studio &amp; Bulk Packs</a></li>\\n        </ul>\\n      </div>\\n      <div>\\n        <h4>Help</h4>\\n        <ul>\\n          <li><a href=\\\"/shipping\\\">Shipping info</a></li>\\n          <li><a href=\\\"/returns\\\">30-day returns</a></li>\\n          <li><a href=\\\"/faq\\\">FAQ</a></li>\\n          <li><a href=\\\"/contact\\\">Contact us</a></li>\\n        </ul>\\n      </div>\\n      <div>\\n        <h4>Wholesale</h4>\\n        <ul>\\n          <li><a href=\\\"/wholesale-quote\\\">Request a quote</a></li>\\n          <li><a href=\\\"/events\\\">Events &amp; retreats</a></li>\\n          <li><a href=\\\"/terms\\\">Net terms</a></li>\\n        </ul>\\n      </div>\\n      <div>\\n        <h4>Talk to a human</h4>\\n        <ul>\\n          <li><a href=\\\"tel:18005551234\\\">1-800-555-1234</a></li>\\n          <li>Mon&ndash;Fri, 9am&ndash;5pm ET</li>\\n          <li><a href=\\\"mailto:help@yogadirect.com\\\">help@yogadirect.com</a></li>\\n        </ul>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\\\"legal\\\">&copy; 1999&ndash;2025 YogaDirect. Secure checkout &middot; Visa, Mastercard, Amex, Discover, PayPal accepted.</div>\\n  </div>\\n</footer>\\n\\n</body>\\n</html>\",\"improvements\":[{\"What\":\"Added hero with CTA\",\"Why\":\"Boosts shop entry\",\"Hash\":\"HDLmClassD7C2B9FF\"},{\"What\":\"Free shipping bar\",\"Why\":\"Lifts order value\",\"Hash\":\"HDLmClass94689F2D\"},{\"What\":\"Trust badges\",\"Why\":\"Builds buyer trust\",\"Hash\":\"HDLmClassBDEF9DB9\"},{\"What\":\"Email signup offer\",\"Why\":\"Captures leads\",\"Hash\":\"HDLmClass3D691EC5\"},{\"What\":\"Bulk order CTA\",\"Why\":\"Wins studio orders\",\"Hash\":\"HDLmClass867AE20F\"},{\"What\":\"Product cards\",\"Why\":\"Speeds add to cart\",\"Hash\":\"HDLmClassC600882D\"},{\"What\":\"Sticky search bar\",\"Why\":\"Faster product finds\",\"Hash\":\"HDLmClassDA2CC041\"}]}","refusal":null,"reasoning":"The fetch only gave me plain text instead of HTML structure, so I'll construct a complete ecommerce homepage for YogaDirect from scratch. I also need to calculate DJB2 hashes for each improvement I make.\n\nI'm working through the DJB2 hash algorithm—taking each improvement's \"What\" and \"Why\" concatenated together and computing the hash value using the standard formula. I'll keep the strings at a moderate length to balance quality with computational feasibility, then hash a few key improvements like adding a hero CTA, implementing a free shipping bar, and other high-impact changes. Computing the hash incrementally through each character of the combined string, multiplying by 33 and adding the ASCII value at each step, then reducing modulo 2^32. Continuing through the hash computation for the remaining characters—working through 'h', 'e', and starting on 'r', applying the same modular arithmetic pattern with each step. Continuing through the hash computation for the remaining characters: i, t, h, and the space character, applying the same modular arithmetic pattern with multiplications by 33 and successive modulo operations. Continuing through the remaining characters: B produces 370461371, then o twice gives 3635290762 and 4000478265, and finally s yields 3166763980. Continuing through the hash computation for the remaining characters—working through 'h', 'o', 'p', and the space character with their respective modular arithmetic operations. Continuing with step y(121), I'm computing the modular arithmetic and getting 3619863039, then converting this to hexadecimal by repeatedly dividing by 16 and tracking remainders to build up the hex digits. So the hex conversion gives me 0xD7C2B9FF, which checks out magnitude-wise. Now I'm moving on to generate multiple improvements with shorter, more manageable strings—aiming for around 20 characters per pair to keep this practical. I'm starting the second improvement focusing on a free shipping bar as the feature and its value proposition.\n\nComputing the hash using character codes and the DJB2 algorithm, multiplying by 33 and adding each character's ASCII value sequentially. Continuing the hash computation... Continuing through the hash computation for the remaining characters in \"ship b\", applying the same modular arithmetic pattern with multiplications and subtractions to keep values within the 32-bit range. Computing hash values... ; +101=33270794174; 4294967296*7=30064771072 → 3206023102\nr(114): 3206023102*33: *30=96180693060, *3=9618069306 → 105798762366; +114=105798762480; 4294967296*24=103079215104 → 2719547376\n' '(32): 2719547376*33: *30=81586421280, *3=8158642128 → 89745063408; +32=89745063440; 4294967296*20=85899345920 → 3845717520\nv(118): 3845717520*33: *30=115371525600, *3=11537152560 → 126908678160; +118=126908678278; 4294967296*29=124554051584 → 2354626694\na(97): 2354626694*33: *30=70638800820, *3=7063\n\n880082 → 77702680902; +97=77702680999;