ud in knowing that you are helping to grow not only your business or personal practice but the Yoga community as a whole. From our team of Yoga lovers to you, thank you.</p>\\n  </div>\\n</section>\\n\\n<section class=\\\"email\\\">\\n  <div class=\\\"wrap\\\">\\n    <h3>Get 10% off your first order</h3>\\n    <p>Join our list for new arrivals, studio deals and practice tips.</p>\\n    <form onsubmit=\\\"return false\\\">\\n      <input type=\\\"email\\\" placeholder=\\\"Enter your email address\\\" aria-label=\\\"Email address\\\" required>\\n      <button class=\\\"btn btn-primary\\\" type=\\\"submit\\\">Send My 10% Code</button>\\n    </form>\\n  </div>\\n</section>\\n\\n<footer class=\\\"site\\\">\\n  <div class=\\\"wrap\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"foot-grid\\\">\\n      <div>\\n        <h4>Shop</h4>\\n        <a href=\\\"/collections/yoga-mats\\\">Yoga Mats</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"/collections/yoga-blocks\\\">Blocks</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"/collections/yoga-straps\\\">Straps</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"/collections/bolsters\\\">Bolsters &amp; Blankets</a>\\n      </div>\\n      <div>\\n        <h4>Business</h4>\\n        <a href=\\\"/pages/wholesale\\\">Wholesale &amp; Bulk</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"/pages/studios\\\">Studio Programs</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"/pages/events\\\">Events &amp; Retreats</a>\\n      </div>\\n      <div>\\n        <h4>Help</h4>\\n        <a href=\\\"/pages/shipping\\\">Shipping Info</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"/pages/returns\\\">Returns</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"/pages/contact\\\">Contact Us</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"/pages/faq\\\">FAQ</a>\\n      </div>\\n      <div>\\n        <h4>Company</h4>\\n        <a href=\\\"/pages/about\\\">About YogaDirect</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"/blogs/news\\\">Blog</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"/pages/privacy\\\">Privacy Policy</a>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n    <div>&copy; 1999&ndash;2025 YogaDirect. Serving the yoga community for over 25 years.</div>\\n  </div>\\n</footer>\\n\\n</body>\\n</html>\",\"impro