erified\\\">Verified Buyer</span></div>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"review\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"stars\\\">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</div>\\n        <p>&ldquo;I&#39;m new to yoga and bought the starter kit. Clear descriptions, fast delivery, and the blocks are firm and well made. Exactly what I needed to begin.&rdquo;</p>\\n        <div class=\\\"who\\\">Ellen K. &mdash; Chicago, IL <span class=\\\"verified\\\">Verified Buyer</span></div>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\\\"cta-center\\\">\\n      <a class=\\\"btn btn-primary\\\" href=\\\"/shop\\\">Shop Top-Rated Yoga Gear</a>\\n      <div style=\\\"margin-top:10px;font-size:14px;color:#6b6b6b\\\">Free shipping over $99 &nbsp;&bull;&nbsp; 30-day easy returns</div>\\n    </div>\\n  </div>\\n</section>\\n\\n<section class=\\\"about\\\">\\n  <div class=\\\"container\\\">\\n    <h2 class=\\\"section-title\\\">Why Shop YogaDirect</h2>\\n    <p>Thanks to our loyal customers, YogaDirect has become one of the largest suppliers of yoga mats and props in the country. We have been faithfully supplying the Yoga community since 1999 and are confident that we can help you grow your studio, event, or personal practice with everything you need and more. We manufacture and source our own goods which is how we can consistently offer high-quality yoga gear at amazing prices. When you shop at YogaDirect, feel proud in knowing that you are helping to grow not only your business or personal practice but the Yoga community as a whole. From our team of Yoga lovers to you, thank you.</p>\\n    <p><a class=\\\"btn btn-primary\\\" href=\\\"/shop\\\">Start Shopping</a></p>\\n  </div>\\n</section>\\n\\n<section class=\\\"newsletter\\\">\\n  <div class=\\\"container\\\">\\n    <h2>Get 10% off your first order</h2>\\n    <p>Join our list for exclusive deals, new arrivals and studio-pricing offers.</p>\\n    <form action=\\\"/subscribe\\\" method=\\\"post\\\">\\n      <input type=\\\"email\\\" name=\\\"emai