 own goods which is how we can consistently offer high-quality yoga gear at amazing prices. When you shop at YogaDirect, feel proud in knowing that you are helping to grow not only your business or personal practice but the Yoga community as a whole. From our team of Yoga lovers to you, thank you.</p>\\n    <p style=\\\"text-align:center;margin-top:22px\\\"><a class=\\\"btn btn-primary\\\" href=\\\"/shop-all/\\\">Start Shopping</a></p>\\n  </div>\\n</section>\\n\\n<section>\\n  <div class=\\\"container faq\\\">\\n    <h2 class=\\\"section-title\\\">Common Questions</h2>\\n    <p class=\\\"section-sub\\\">Everything shoppers ask before they order.</p>\\n    <details open><summary>How fast will my order ship?</summary><p>In-stock orders placed before 2pm ET ship the same or next business day from our US warehouse.</p></details>\\n    <details><summary>When is shipping free?</summary><p>Standard shipping is free on all orders over $99 within the contiguous US. Freight quotes are available for large studio orders.</p></details>\\n    <details><summary>Do you offer bulk or studio discounts?</summary><p>Yes. Tiered volume pricing starts at just a few units, and our team can build a custom package for studios, schools, hotels and events.</p></details>\\n    <details><summary>What is your return policy?</summary><p>Unused items can be returned within 30 days for a refund or exchange. Contact us and we'll make it simple.</p></details>\\n  </div>\\n</section>\\n\\n<section class=\\\"email HDLmClass189D27B7\\\">\\n  <div class=\\\"container\\\">\\n    <h2>Get 10% Off Your First Order</h2>\\n    <p>Join our email list for a instant discount code, plus early access to sales and new gear for your practice or studio.</p>\\n    <form action=\\\"/subscribe\\\" method=\\\"post\\\">\\n      <label for=\\\"email\\\" style=\\\"position:absolute;left:-9999px\\\">Email address</label>\\n      <input id=\\\"email\\\" name=\\\"email\\\" type=\\\"email\\\" required placeholder=\\\"you@email.com\\\">\\n      <button type=\\\"submit\\\">Send My 10% Code</button>\\n    </form>\\n    <small>No spam. Unsubscribe anytime.</small>\\n  </div>\\n</section>\\n\\n<footer class=\\\"site\\\">\\n  <div class=\\\"container foot-grid\\\">\\n    <div>\\n      <h4>Shop</h4>\\n      <ul>\\n        <li><a href=\\\"/yoga-mats/\\\">Yoga Mats</a></li>\\n        <li><a href=\\\"/yoga-blocks/\\\">Blocks &amp; Wedges</a></li>\\n        <li><a href=\\\"/yoga-straps/\\\">Straps</a></li>\\n        <li><a href=\\\"/yoga-bolsters/\\\">Bolsters</a></li>\\n        <li><a href=\\\"/sale/\\\">Sale</a></li>\\n      </ul>\\n    </div>\\n    <div>\\n      <h4>Wholesale</h4>\\n      <ul>\\n        <li><a href=\\\"/wholesale/\\\">Bulk Pricing</a></li>\\n        <li><a href=\\\"/studio-packs/\\\">Studio Packs</a></li>\\n        <li><a href=\\\"/wholesale/\\\">Request a Quote</a></li>\\n      </ul>\\n    </div>\\n    <div>\\n      <h4>Help</h4>\\n      <ul>\\n        <li><a href=\\\"/shipping-returns/\\\">Shipping &amp; Returns</a></li>\\n        <li><a href=\\\"/contact-us/\\\">Contact Us</a></li>\\n        <li><a href=\\\"/faq/\\\">FAQ</a></li>\\n        <li><a href=\\\"/account\\\">Order Status</a></li>\\n      </ul>\\n    </div>\\n    <div>\\n      <h4>Talk to a Human</h4>\\n      <ul>\\n        <li><a href=\\\"tel:18009642453\\\">1-800-964-2453</a></li>\\n        <li>Mon&ndash;Fri, 9am&ndash;5pm ET</li>\\n        <li><a href=\\\"mailto:support@yogadirect.com\\\">support@yogadirect.com</a></li>\\n      </ul>\\n    </div>\\n  </div>\\n  <div class=\\\"container\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:24px;border-top:1px solid #3a4145;padding-top:16px;font-size:13px\\\">&copy; 1999&ndash;2025 YogaDirect. Supplying the yoga community for 25+ years.</div>\\n</footer>\\n\\n<div class=\\\"sticky-cta HDLmClass46655669\\\"><a href=\\\"/shop-all/\\\">Shop Yoga Mats &amp; Props &rarr;</a></div>\\n\\n</body>\\n</html>\",\"improvements\":[{\"What\":\"Added hero banner with CTA\",\"Why\":\"Guides users to shop faster