n    </div>\\n  </div>\\n</header>\\n\\n<nav class=\\\"main\\\">\\n  <div class=\\\"wrap\\\">\\n    <ul>\\n      <li><a href=\\\"/yoga-mats\\\">Yoga Mats</a></li>\\n      <li><a href=\\\"/yoga-blocks\\\">Blocks &amp; Wedges</a></li>\\n      <li><a href=\\\"/yoga-straps\\\">Straps</a></li>\\n      <li><a href=\\\"/yoga-bolsters\\\">Bolsters &amp; Cushions</a></li>\\n      <li><a href=\\\"/yoga-blankets\\\">Blankets</a></li>\\n      <li><a href=\\\"/props\\\">Props &amp; Accessories</a></li>\\n      <li><a href=\\\"/studio-packs\\\">Studio Packs</a></li>\\n      <li><a href=\\\"/sale\\\">Sale</a></li>\\n    </ul>\\n  </div>\\n</nav>\\n\\n<section class=\\\"hero\\\">\\n  <div class=\\\"wrap\\\">\\n    <h1>Yoga mats and props direct from the source</h1>\\n    <p>Supplying studios, events and home practices since 1999.</p>\\n    <a class=\\\"btn\\\" href=\\\"/yoga-mats\\\">Shop Yoga Mats</a>\\n    <a class=\\\"btn secondary\\\" href=\\\"/studio-packs\\\">Shop Studio Packs</a>\\n  </div>\\n</section>\\n\\n<div class=\\\"trust\\\">\\n  <span>Manufacturer-direct pricing</span>\\n  <span>Trusted since 1999</span>\\n  <span>Bulk &amp; wholesale discounts</span>\\n  <span>Friendly US-based support</span>\\n</div>\\n\\n<div class=\\\"wrap\\\">\\n  <div class=\\\"offer-strip HDLmClass739F83CC\\\">New here? <strong>Save 10% on your first order</strong> plus early access to sales &mdash; <a href=\\\"#email-signup\\\">sign up for emails</a>.</div>\\n</div>\\n\\n<div class=\\\"wrap\\\">\\n  <h2 class=\\\"section\\\">Featured Products</h2>\\n  <div class=\\\"grid\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"card\\\"><div class=\\\"ph\\\"></div><h3>Deluxe Yoga Mat</h3><div class=\\\"price\\\">$24.95</div><a class=\\\"btn\\\" href=\\\"/yoga-mats\\\">Shop Now</a></div>\\n    <div class=\\\"card\\\"><div class=\\\"ph\\\"></div><h3>Foam Yoga Block</h3><div class=\\\"price\\\">$8.95</div><a class=\\\"btn\\\" href=\\\"/yoga-blocks\\\">Shop Now</a></div>\\n    <div class=\\\"card\\\"><div class=\\\"ph\\\"></div><h3>Cotton Yoga Strap</h3><div class=\\\"price\\\">$7.95</div><a class=\\\"btn\\\" href=\\\"/yoga-straps\\\">Shop Now</a></div>\\n    <div class=\\\"card\\\"><div class=\\\"ph\\\"></div><h3>Rectangular Bolster</h3><div class=\\\"price\\\">$39.95</div><a class=\\\"btn\\\" href=\\\"/yoga-bolsters\\\">Shop Now</a></div>\\n    <div class=\\\"card\\\"><div class=\\\"ph\\\"></div><h3>Mexican Yoga Blanket</h3><div class=\\\"price\\\">$19.95</div><a class=\\\"btn\\\" href=\\\"/yoga-blankets\\\">Shop Now</a></div>\\n    <div class=\\\"card\\\"><div class=\\\"ph\\\"></div><h3>Studio Starter Pack</h3><div class=\\\"price\\\">From $199</div><a class=\\\"btn\\\" href=\\\"/studio-packs\\\">Shop Now</a></div>\\n  </div>\\n</div>\\n\\n<section class=\\\"email-offer HDLmClass739F83CC\\\" id=\\\"email-signup\\\">\\n  <div class=\\\"wrap inner\\\">\\n    <div>\\n      <h2>Get 10% off your first order</h2>\\n      <p>Join the YogaDirect email list for exclusive discounts, new product news and studio-pricing offers.</p>\\n    </div>\\n    <form action=\\\"/subscribe\\\" method=\\\"post\\\" novalidate>\\n      <label for=\\\"signup-email\\\" style=\\\"position:absolute;left:-9999px\\\">Email address</label>\\n      <input id=\\\"signup-email\\\" name=\\\"email\\\" type=\\\"email\\\" required placeholder=\\\"Enter your email address\\\">\\n      <button class=\\\"btn\\\" type=\\\"submit\\\">Get My 10% Off</button>\\n      <small>One-click unsubscribe anytime. We never share your email.</small>\\n    </form>\\n  </div>\\n</section>\\n\\n<section class=\\\"about\\\">\\n  <div class=\\\"wrap\\\">\\n    <p>Thanks to our loyal customers, YogaDirect has become one of the largest suppliers of yoga mats and props in the country. We have been faithfully supplying the Yoga community since 1999 and are confident that we can help you grow your studio, event, or personal practice with everything you need and more. We manufacture and source our own goods which is how we can consistently offer high-quality yoga gear at amazing prices. When you shop at YogaDirect, feel proud in knowing that you are helping to grow not only your business or personal practice but the Yoga community as a whole. From our team of Yoga lovers to you, thank you.</p>\\n  </div>\\n</section>\\n\\n<footer>\\n  <div class=\\\"wrap fcols\\\">\\n    <div>\\n      <h4>Shop</h4>\\n      <div><a href=\\\"/yoga-mats\\\">Yoga Mats</a></div>\\n      <div><a href=\\\"/yoga-blocks\\\">Blocks</a></div>\\n      <div><a href=\\\"/yoga-straps\\\">Straps</a></div>\\n      <div><a href=\\\"/sale\\\">Sale</a></div>\\n    </div>\\n    <div>\\n      <h4>Customer Service</h4>\\n      <div><a href=\\\"/contact\\\">Contact Us</a></div>\\n      <div><a href=\\\"/shipping\\\">Shipping</a></div>\\n      <div><a href=\\\"/returns\\\">Returns</a></div>\\n      <div><a href=\\\"/faq\\\">FAQ</a></div>\\n    </div>\\n    <div>\\n      <h4>Company</h4>\\n      <div><a href=\\\"/about\\\">About Us</a></div>\\n      <div><a href=\\\"/wholesale\\\">Wholesale</a></div>\\n      <div><a href=\\\"/privacy\\\">Privacy Policy</a></div>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\\\"HDLmClass739F83CC\\\">\\n      <h4>Save 10% Today</h4>\\n      <p style=\\\"margin:0 0 10px\\\">Sign up for email offers and get 10% off your first order.</p>\\n      <form action=\\\"/subscribe\\\" method=\\\"post\\\" novalidate>\\n        <label for=\\\"footer-email\\\" style=\\\"position:absolute;left:-9999px\\\">Email address</label>\\n        <input id=\\\"footer-email\\\" name=\\\"email\\\" type=\\\"email\\\" required placeholder=\\\"Your email address\\\" style=\\\"width:100%;padding:11px;border:0;border-radius:4px;margin-bottom:8px;font-size:15px\\\">\\n        <button class=\\\"btn\\\" type=\\\"submit\\\" style=\\\"width:100%\\\">Sign Up &amp; Save</button>\\n      </form>\\n    </div>\\n  </div>\\n  <div class=\\\"wrap\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:22px;color:#999\\\">&copy; 1999&ndash;2024 YogaDirect.com. All rights reserved.</div>\\n</footer>\\n\\n<div id=\\