{"id":"gen-1785702720-sTLfsiq0FmzpHBPhRNG4","object":"chat.completion","created":1785702720,"model":"anthropic/claude-fable-5","provider":"Amazon Bedrock","system_fingerprint":null,"service_tier":"default","choices":[{"index":0,"logprobs":null,"finish_reason":"stop","native_finish_reason":"end_turn","message":{"role":"assistant","content":"{\"improvedHtml\": \"<!DOCTYPE html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n<head>\\n<meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\">\\n<meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\\\">\\n<title>YogaDirect - Yoga Mats, Yoga Props, Yoga Supplies &amp; Yoga Gear</title>\\n<meta name=\\\"description\\\" content=\\\"YogaDirect is one of the largest suppliers of yoga mats and props in the country, faithfully supplying the Yoga community since 1999 with high-quality yoga gear at amazing prices.\\\">\\n<style>\\n  body { margin: 0; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #333; }\\n  .promo-banner { background: #2e7d32; color: #ffffff; text-align: center; padding: 12px 16px; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold; }\\n  .promo-banner a { color: #ffeb3b; text-decoration: underline; margin-left: 10px; font-weight: bold; }\\n  .promo-banner a:hover { color: #ffffff; }\\n  header { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; padding: 16px 32px; border-bottom: 1px solid #e0e0e0; }\\n  .logo { font-size: 28px; font-weight: bold; color: #2e7d32; text-decoration: none; }\\n  nav ul { list-style: none; display: flex; gap: 24px; margin: 0; padding: 0; }\\n  nav a { text-decoration: none; color: #333; font-weight: 600; }\\n  nav a:hover { color: #2e7d32; }\\n  .hero { background: #f4f9f4; text-align: center; padding: 60px 20px; }\\n  .hero h1 { font-size: 36px; margin: 0 0 16px; color: #2e7d32; }\\n  .hero p { font-size: 18px; max-width: 700px; margin: 0 auto 24px; }\\n  .cta-button { display: inline-block; background: #2e7d32; color: #fff; padding: 14px 32px; border-radius: 4px; text-decoration: none; font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold; }\\n  .cta-button:hover { background: #1b5e20; }\\n  .featured { padding: 48px 32px; }\\n  .featured h2 { text-align: center; font-size: 28px; margin-bottom: 32px; }\\n  .product-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr)); gap: 24px; }\\n  .product-card { border: 1px solid #e0e0e0; border-radius: 6px; padding: 16px; text-align: center; }\\n  .product-card h3 { font-size: 18px; margin: 12px 0 8px; }\\n  .product-card .price { color: #2e7d32; font-weight: bold; font-size: 18px; }\\n  .about { background: #fafafa; padding: 48px 32px; }\\n  .about p { max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.7; }\\n  footer { background: #263238; color: #cfd8dc; padding: 32px; text-align: center; font-size: 14px; }\\n  footer a { color: #cfd8dc; }\\n</style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n\\n<!-- Top Promotional Banner -->\\n<div class=\\\"promo-banner HDLmClassa43a06b5\\\" role=\\\"banner\\\">\\n  FREE SHIPPING on orders over $75 &nbsp;|&nbsp; Take 15% OFF your order with code <strong>YOGA15</strong>\\n  <a href=\\\"/yoga-mats.html\\\">Shop Now &raquo;</a>\\n</div>\\n\\n<header>\\n  <a href=\\\"/\\\" class=\\\"logo\\\">YogaDirect</a>\\n  <nav>\\n    <ul>\\n      <li><a href=\\\"/yoga-mats.html\\\">Yoga Mats</a></li>\\n      <li><a href=\\\"/yoga-props.html\\\">Yoga Props</a></li>\\n      <li><a href=\\\"/yoga-bolsters.html\\\">Bolsters</a></li>\\n      <li><a href=\\\"/yoga-blocks.html\\\">Blocks</a></li>\\n      <li><a href=\\\"/yoga-clothing.html\\\">Clothing</a></li>\\n      <li><a href=\\\"/sale.html\\\">Sale</a></li>\\n    </ul>\\n  </nav>\\n</header>\\n\\n<section class=\\\"hero\\\">\\n  <h1>High-Quality Yoga Gear at Amazing Prices</h1>\\n  <p>One of the largest suppliers of yoga mats and props in the country, faithfully serving the Yoga community since 1999.</p>\\n  <a href=\\\"/yoga-mats.html\\\" class=\\\"cta-button\\\">Shop Yoga Mats</a>\\n</section>\\n\\n<section class=\\\"featured\\\">\\n  <h2>Featured Products</h2>\\n  <div class=\\\"product-grid\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"product-card\\\">\\n      <h3>Classic Yoga Mat</h3>\\n      <p class=\\\"price\\\">From $12.95</p>\\n      <a href=\\\"/yoga-mats.html\\\" class=\\\"cta-button\\\">Shop Now</a>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\\\"product-card\\\">\\n      <h3>Yoga Bolsters</h3>\\n      <p class=\\\"price\\\">From $24.95</p>\\n      <a href=\\\"/yoga-bolsters.html\\\" class=\\\"cta-button\\\">Shop Now</a>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\\\"product-card\\\">\\n      <h3>Foam Yoga Blocks</h3>\\n      <p class=\\\"price\\\">From $6.95</p>\\n      <a href=\\\"/yoga-blocks.html\\\" class=\\\"cta-button\\\">Shop Now</a>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\\\"product-card\\\">\\n      <h3>Yoga Straps</h3>\\n      <p class=\\\"price\\\">From $4.95</p>\\n      <a href=\\\"/yoga-props.html\\\" class=\\\"cta-button\\\">Shop Now</a>\\n    </div>\\n  </div>\\n</section>\\n\\n<section class=\\\"about\\\">\\n  <p>Thanks to our loyal customers, YogaDirect has become one of the largest suppliers of yoga mats and props in the country. We have been faithfully supplying the Yoga community since 1999 and are confident that we can help you grow your studio, event, or personal practice with everything you need and more. We manufacture and source our own goods which is how we can consistently offer high-quality yoga gear at amazing prices. When you shop at YogaDirect, feel proud in knowing that you are helping to grow not only your business or personal practice but the Yoga community as a whole. From our team of Yoga lovers to you, thank you.</p>\\n</section>\\n\\n<footer>\\n  <p>&copy; YogaDirect. All rights reserved. | <a href=\\\"/contact-us.html\\\">Contact Us</a> | <a href=\\\"/shipping.html\\\">Shipping</a> | <a href=\\\"/returns.html\\\">Returns</a></p>\\n</footer>\\n\\n</body>\\n</html>\", \"improvements\": [{\"What\": \"Added a top promotional banner offering free shipping over $75 and a 15% discount code with a Shop Now link\", \"Why\