gin-bottom: 24px; }\\n  .about { max-width: 860px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 24px 32px 64px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.7; }\\n  .site-footer { background: #f5f5f5; text-align: center; padding: 24px; font-size: 14px; color: #666; }\\n</style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n<header class=\\\"site-header\\\">\\n  <a href=\\\"/\\\" class=\\\"logo\\\">YogaDirect</a>\\n  <nav class=\\\"site-nav\\\">\\n    <a href=\\\"/yoga-mats/\\\">Yoga Mats</a>\\n    <a href=\\\"/yoga-props/\\\">Yoga Props</a>\\n    <a href=\\\"/yoga-bolsters/\\\">Bolsters</a>\\n    <a href=\\\"/yoga-blocks/\\\">Blocks</a>\\n    <a href=\\\"/wholesale/\\\">Wholesale</a>\\n  </nav>\\n</header>\\n\\n<section class=\\\"hero HDLmClass83f44239\\\">\\n  <h1>High-Quality Yoga Gear at Amazing Prices</h1>\\n  <p>Trusted by studios, events, and home practitioners since 1999. Shop factory-direct yoga mats and props from one of the largest suppliers in the country.</p>\\n  <a href=\\\"/best-sellers/\\\" class=\\\"cta-button\\\">Shop Best Sellers</a>\\n</section>\\n\\n<section class=\\\"featured\\\">\\n  <h2>Featured Products</h2>\\n</section>\\n\\n<section class=\\\"about\\\">\\n  <p>Thanks to our loyal customers, YogaDirect has become one of the largest suppliers of yoga mats and props in the country. We have been faithfully supplying the Yoga community since 1999 and are confident that we can help you grow your studio, event, or personal practice with everything you need and more. We manufacture and source our own goods which is how we can consistently offer high-quality yoga gear at amazing prices. When you shop at YogaDirect, feel proud in knowing that you are helping to grow not only your business or personal practice but the Yoga community as a whole. From our team of Yoga lovers to you, thank you.</p>\\n</section>\\n\\n<footer class=\\\"site-footer\\\">\\n  <p>&copy; YogaDirect. All rights reserved.</p>\\n</footer>\\n</body>\\n</html>\", \"improvements\": [{\"What\": \"Added a hero section with a clear value prop