href=\\\"/account\\\">My Account</a>\\n    <a href=\\\"/cart\\\">Cart</a>\\n  </div>\\n</header>\\n\\n<div class=\\\"trust-bar HDLmClass3822a153\\\">\\n  <div class=\\\"trust-item\\\"><span class=\\\"trust-icon\\\">&#127942;</span> Trusted Since 1999</div>\\n  <div class=\\\"trust-item\\\"><span class=\\\"trust-icon\\\">&#128666;</span> Free Shipping</div>\\n  <div class=\\\"trust-item\\\"><span class=\\\"trust-icon\\\">&#128274;</span> Secure Checkout</div>\\n  <div class=\\\"trust-item\\\"><span class=\\\"trust-icon\\\">&#8617;</span> 30-Day Easy Returns</div>\\n</div>\\n\\n<nav class=\\\"main-nav\\\">\\n  <ul>\\n    <li><a href=\\\"/yoga-mats\\\">Yoga Mats</a></li>\\n    <li><a href=\\\"/yoga-props\\\">Yoga Props</a></li>\\n    <li><a href=\\\"/yoga-bolsters\\\">Bolsters</a></li>\\n    <li><a href=\\\"/yoga-blocks\\\">Blocks</a></li>\\n    <li><a href=\\\"/yoga-blankets\\\">Blankets</a></li>\\n    <li><a href=\\\"/meditation\\\">Meditation</a></li>\\n    <li><a href=\\\"/wholesale\\\">Wholesale</a></li>\\n    <li><a href=\\\"/sale\\\">Sale</a></li>\\n  </ul>\\n</nav>\\n\\n<section class=\\\"hero\\\">\\n  <h1>High-Quality Yoga Gear at Amazing Prices</h1>\\n  <p>Everything you need to grow your studio, event, or personal practice &mdash; direct from one of the largest suppliers of yoga mats and props in the country.</p>\\n  <a href=\\\"/yoga-mats\\\" class=\\\"cta-button\\\">Shop Yoga Mats</a>\\n</section>\\n\\n<section class=\\\"featured\\\">\\n  <h2>Featured Products</h2>\\n  <div class=\\\"product-grid\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"product-card\\\">\\n      <img src=\\\"/images/products/classic-yoga-mat.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"Classic Yoga Mat\\\">\\n      <h3>Classic Yoga Mat</h3>\\n      <div class=\\\"price\\\">$14.95</div>\\n      <a href=\\\"/products/classic-yoga-mat\\\" class=\\\"buy-button\\\">Shop Now</a>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\\\"product-card\\\">\\n      <img src=\\\"/images/products/yoga-bolster.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"Supportive Round Yoga Bolster\\\">\\n      <h3>Supportive Round Yoga Bolster</h3>\\n      <div class=\\\"price\\\">$34.95</div>\\n      <a href=\\\"/products/yoga-bolster\\\" class=\\\"buy-button\\\">Shop Now</a>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\\\"product-card\\\">\\n      <img src=\\\"/images/products/foam-yoga-block.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"Foam Yoga Block\\\">\\n      <h3>Foam Yoga Block</h3>\\n      <div class=\\\"price\\\">$7.95</div>\\n      <a href=\\\"/products/foam-yoga-block\\\" class=\\\"buy-button\\\">Shop Now</a>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\\\"product-card\\\">\\n      <img src=\\\"/images/products/cotton-yoga-blanket.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"Cotton Yoga Blanket\\\">\\n      <h3>Cotton Yoga Blanket</h3>\\n      <div class=\\\"price\\\">$19.95</div>\\n      <a href=\\\"/products/cotton-yoga-blanket\\\" class=\\\"buy-button\\\">Shop Now</a>\\n    </div>\\n  </div>\\n</section>\\n\\n<section class=\\\"about\\\">\\n  <div class=\\\"about-inner\\\">\\n    <h2>About YogaDirect</h2>\\n    <p>Thanks to our loyal customers, YogaDirect has become one of the largest suppliers of yoga mats and props in the country. We have been faithfully supplying the Yoga community since 1999 and are confident that we can help you grow your studio, event, or personal practice with everything you need and more. We manufacture and source our own goods which is how we can consistently offer high-quality yoga gear at amazing prices. When you shop at YogaDirect, feel proud in knowing that you are helping to grow not only your business or personal practice but the Yoga community as a whole. From our team of Yoga lovers to you, thank you.</p>\\n  </div>\\n</section>\\n\\n<footer class=\\\"site-footer\\\">\\n  <div class=\\\"footer-columns\\\">\\n    <div>\\n      <h4>Shop</h4>\\n      <ul>\\n        <li><a href=\\\"/yoga-mats\\\">Yoga Mats</a></li>\\n        <li><a href=\\\"/yoga-props\\\">Yoga Props</a></li>\\n        <li><a href=\\\"/wholesale\\\">Wholesale</a></li>\\n        <li><a href=\\\"/sale\\\">Sale</a></li>\\n      </ul>\\n    </div>\