Cart</a></div><div class=\\\"product-card\\\"><img src=\\\"/images/yoga-bolster.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"Round Cotton Yoga Bolster\\\" loading=\\\"lazy\\\"><h3>Round Cotton Yoga Bolster</h3><p class=\\\"price\\\">$34.95</p><p class=\\\"compare\\\">$49.95</p><a href=\\\"/yoga-bolster\\\" class=\\\"buy\\\">Add to Cart</a></div><div class=\\\"product-card\\\"><img src=\\\"/images/yoga-strap.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"8 Foot Cotton Yoga Strap\\\" loading=\\\"lazy\\\"><h3>8' Cotton Yoga Strap</h3><p class=\\\"price\\\">$5.95</p><p class=\\\"compare\\\">$9.95</p><a href=\\\"/yoga-strap\\\" class=\\\"buy\\\">Add to Cart</a></div></div></main><section class=\\\"about\\\"><p>Thanks to our loyal customers, YogaDirect has become one of the largest suppliers of yoga mats and props in the country. We have been faithfully supplying the Yoga community since 1999 and are confident that we can help you grow your studio, event, or personal practice with everything you need and more. We manufacture and source our own goods which is how we can consistently offer high-quality yoga gear at amazing prices. When you shop at YogaDirect, feel proud in knowing that you are helping to grow not only your business or personal practice but the Yoga community as a whole. From our team of Yoga lovers to you, thank you.</p></section><section class=\\\"testimonials HDLmClassEDCF5CE7\\\"><div class=\\\"container\\\"><h2 class=\\\"section-title\\\">What Our Customers Say</h2><div class=\\\"testimonial-grid\\\"><blockquote class=\\\"testimonial\\\"><div class=\\\"stars\\\">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</div>Outstanding quality mats at prices no one else can match. I outfitted my entire studio with YogaDirect gear.<cite>&mdash; Sarah M., Studio Owner</cite></blockquote><blockquote class=\\\"testimonial\\\"><div class=\\\"stars\\\">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</div>Fast shipping and the bolsters are incredibly durable. My go-to shop for all yoga props.<cite>&mdash; David R., Yoga Instructor</cite></blockquote><b