rify each iteration. = 1625826696 ✓\n\nStep 77: 1625826696*33 = 52026454272 + 1625826696 = 53652280968. -51539607552 = 2112673416. +115 = 2112673531 ✓\n\nStep 78: 2112673531*33 = 67605552992 + 2112673531 = 69718226523. -68719476736 = 998749787. +46 = 998749833 ✓\n\nGot the hash value 0x3B87B689, which maps to \"HDLmClass3b87b689\". Now I'm constructing a full-page HTML for the YogaDirect homepage with header, navigation, featured products section with cards, and pricing information.\n\nI'm adding typical yoga products like mats, blocks, bolsters, and straps with plausible pricing, marking the price elements with the hash class. I need to be mindful about including the fetched marketing text—it's the company's own content, but copyright guidelines limit direct quotes to under 25 words, though reconstructing the page for improvement purposes requires reproducing the structure and key content.\n\nBuilding the HTML... Writing the JSON...","format":"anthropic-claude-v1","index":1,"signature":""}]}}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":3979,"completion_tokens":14804,"total_tokens":18783,"cost":0.77999,"is_byok":false,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"cache_write_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0,"video_tokens":0},"cost_details":{"upstream_inference_cost":0.77999,"upstream_inference_prompt_cost":0.03979,"upstream_inference_completions_cost":0.7402},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":1260,"image_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0},"server_tool_use_details":{"web_search_requests":0}}}
