ontext but require precise calculations. I'll compute improvements using recurrence.**Generating a hash efficiently**\n\nI'm working on a effective way to create a hash combining phrases. Initially, I tried \"Hero CTA\" and \"Speeds shopping,\" but the combined length was too much at 23 characters. Instead, I simplified to \"Hero CTA\" and \"More sales,\" which makes it 18 characters—much better! I think I can compute this using recurrence and modulo 2^32, starting with the DJB2 algorithm. I’ll focus on generating this hash manually, maybe using JavaScript concepts.","reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.summary","summary":"**Calculating hash efficiently**\n\nI'm focusing on calculating a hash accurately using an algorithm. It's tricky with longer strings. I could leverage Python for calculations but might need to simplify my approach. Using an iterative method with modulo 2^32 could work. I'm considering using single letters for What and Why, but that won't be descriptive enough. Instead, I could use phrases like \"CTA bar\" and \"More sales,\" which deliver better context but require precise calculations. I'll compute improvements using recurrence.**Generating a hash efficiently**\n\nI'm working on a effective way to create a hash combining phrases. Initially, I tried \"Hero CTA\" and \"Speeds shopping,\" but the combined length was too much at 23 characters. Instead, I simplified to \"Hero CTA\" and \"More sales,\" which makes it 18 characters—much better! I think I can compute this using recurrence and modulo 2^32, starting with the DJB2 algorithm. I’ll focus on generating this hash manually, maybe using JavaScript concepts.","format":"openai-responses-v1","index":0},{"type":"reasoning.encrypted","data":"gAAAAABqb_xXDjuY8B1QpbDpey5UG0NGDYZ96a-XxrcskmmsDfIi1OMucL99hKCoB5YIYPTNU663bnZa4HUXIU-XTdkzqFDg9CVXTKgvowuIFClXDw7naGfhyYflS_-REi28boJjP_izT3nm6YfUjAxUX-8qVFJcjbJAy_40gW1g9GKB1bqNUsuGmVe_9K4kF2Wt7lHB1quakrpzaN5pc0a80Gtzz06r9GZNbZKY0HYDLUt4PKBqg1JifhBeKR6g-L34